window.products.push({"id":925069,"name":"Seville Classics UltraZinc 2-Tier Pull-Out Sliding Basket Cabinet Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XaNvYaRcL._AC_SL1459_.jpg","description":"Keep all your kitchenware, small appliances and other cookware handy with Seville Classics' Single Basket Kitchen Cabinet Organizer. This system is constructed from industrial-strength steel and features UltraZinc ; plating, which provides the same corrosion resistance and a similar shine to chrome plating. Each basket can hold up to 20 lbs. while the top-shelf holds up to 40 lbs. Both shelf and basket are also adjustable vertically at 1-inch intervals. Includes adjustable leveling feet for support and balance. Zinc plating provides necessary corrosion resistance in dry environments Zinc plating provides necessary corrosion resistance in dry environments Industrial-strength steel wire construction for multipurpose storage Industrial-strength steel wire construction for multipurpose storage Stackable with other single basket and double basket organizers Stackable with other single basket and double basket organizers Padded leveling feet provided for non-slip use Padded leveling feet provided for non-slip use No tools required for assembly No tools required for assembly Specifications Dimensions: 17.5\" D x 11.5\" W x 18.5\" H Capacity per basket: 15 lbs. Capacity per shelf: 40 lbs. Weight: 6.5 lbs. Model #: SHE05102ZB What's in the Box? 4 poles  4 leveling feet 8 slip sleeves 2 sidebars 1 shelf 1 wire basket (8\" D x 15.75\" W x 4.5\" H)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XaNvYaRcL._AC_SL1459_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seville Classics","source_asin":"B00W6OJIEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W6OJIEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W6OJIEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":925070,"name":"Manual Fringed 50 x 60-Inch Tapestry Throw, La Provence Roosters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91F3qU-pwwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91F3qU-pwwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B008DVK78I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008DVK78I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008DVK78I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
