window.products.push({"id":925115,"name":"UniqueFire Full Tang 8 inch Cleaver Chopper Butcher Knife Handmade Forged Chef Knife High Carbon Clad Steel Heavy-duty Cleaver Chinese Knife for Home,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zSB+3kv2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality: The thick and sturdy blade of the knife is made of 5Cr15 carbon steel. It is not made of stainless steel, so after each use, you may need keep it clean and dry to resist rust. Adopted vacuum heated treatment and cooling treatment, the hardness of this knife can be up to 58 HRC. The steel is extremely hard and makes the blade really sharp and durable. Sharp Blade: Hand sharpened by experienced artisans. This kitchen knife has a V angle on the blade and a very thin, ultra-sharp blade thickness. The wide blade of this chopper knife allows the chef's fingers to work perfectly away from the cutting surface. Durable and strong, it cuts into large pieces of food with great ease. Handle: Our knife handle is made of Premium Wenge Wood, and the wave handle design is much better than normal wooden handle, and the slip resistant triple riveted handle provides comfortable and ergonomic handling. Solid full tang, no-welded handle effectively prevents handle from deformation or fracture. Moreover, it reduces hand fatigue when you need a long time use. Heavy-Duty: This chopper cleaver as well as heavy-duty chef knife is special designed for Bones, To make it the best choose for heavy-duty cutting job. This cleaver heavier than normal kitchen cleaver to provide a sooth feeling when cut through Bones. Please feel the charming side of heavy-duty cutting in your kitchen. Guarantee: We ensure that our boning knife will meet your expectation. We also provide 12-month warranty for quality-related issues, 30-day money back guarantee for any reason and friendly customer service. Perfect for collection and also a great gift for your family, friend or yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zSB+3kv2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UniqueFire","source_asin":"B08Z3GWNJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3GWNJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3GWNJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
