window.products.push({"id":925183,"name":"SATVIK 12 Pc. of Reusable Decorative Tissue Paper Frill Garland with 12 Pc. Paper Star, Indoor/Outdoor Happy Diwali Hanging Decoration Toran/Bandhanwa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-SI9-UqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative Frills gives a special modern touch to your Bandhanwar ( Toran). This Traditional piece of art is a perfect embellishment for your room or office. A Lovely Designer door Hanging. The beautiful colors in this Toran is simply amazing . This festive season make your home look absolutely amazing by decorating your doors with these hangings. A perfect addition to your home as Window and door vallace. Diyas are an essential part of Diwali decoration. To considering this we came with the beautiful range of Diwali Collections. You can decor your home on Diwali festival with Door Valances, Toran, Door Hangings Diya, Tea-light holders, oil lamp, earthen diya, traditional diya, natural diya, colorful diya, designer diya, clay diya, terracotta diya, plain diya, stone diya, metal diya, shadow diya, door valance, toran, rangoli, colors, puja thali, pooja thali, platter, frills, hanging ball, paper lentern, big diyas, laxmi ganesha statue, luxmi, lakshmi, lord ganesha, Ganpati, diwali pujan, deepmala. Use the above items to decorate your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-SI9-UqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SATVIK","source_asin":"B0BC1LDYFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC1LDYFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC1LDYFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":925184,"name":"Design Toscano Divine Offering Cast Iron Sculptural Bookend Pair, Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815wpZqk0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Namaste. Treat your books with the reverence they deserve with this Divine Offering pair of hands posed in a gesture of respectful greeting and farewell in India. Also known as Anjali Munda, it is performed by pressing the palms of the hands together: as Anjali meaning \"to offer, salutation\" and Munda \"seal or sign. \" Also used as a centering pose in yoga, preformed seated or standing, it has been said that two hands joined provide a connection between right and left brain and will offer a deeper meaning. Bookends serve as punctuation marks in a library, showcasing your respectful interest and will add character to any room, self, or credenza. These always \"at the offering\" pair of bookends serve as functional art while giving literary support to your favorite books. Hand-crafted in heavyweight foundry cast iron for exclusively Design Toscano, these Divine Offering sculptural bookends are then hand painted and distressed just enough to replicate a true antique. Each 5\"Wx2½ \"Dx9\"H. 5 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815wpZqk0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Design Toscano","source_asin":"B07KYJMC5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KYJMC5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KYJMC5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
