window.products.push({"id":925528,"name":"MAYSHINE Plush Shaggy Chenille Bath Mat, Extra Soft, Super Absorbent Water, Non-Slip, Machine Washable Microfiber Fluffy Bathroom Rugs (20.5X35 inch P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Iev-IjzyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Know Us :) We are a professional manufacturer of bathroom mats. And we know what kinds of good mats are needed by consumers. MAYSHINE luxury chenille bathroom mat provides comfortable underfoot support and protects your toes from cold floor just like sinking into a deep cotton pile. We have prepared many sizes and colors for you, choosing the mats to coordinate with home decoration. Machine-wash :) Simply throw the mat into the washing machine, wash warm with neutral detergent, hang to dry or air dry flat at low temperatures. After 10 times machine wash test, the MAYSHINE bath mat still looks as good as the new one. No worry about it getting the fibers off, it's really easy to handle and care. In addition, we recommend that you use washing machine who's load is more than 6kg and wash it at least once a week. In this way, you can maintain your rug. Technique :) Unique fiber-locking technique, say goodbye to horrible fiber-dropping! The mat is composed of 3 layers: fabric layer, middle sponge layer and bottom anti-skid layer. We use the PVC backing (not TPR or glue) which is much stronger and durable for long lasting use. It is designed to absorb water to dry your feet quickly that can make your bathroom floors quickly dry and clean. This soft bath rug is for the outside of shower and the outside of tub. Comfort :) The fibers are very dense and not easily turn deflated after use, so it offers exceptional comfort and support for your feet and can maintain a new look. Height of the fibers: about 1\" long (2.5 cm); Especially soft and thick microfibers relieve pressure and fatigue on your feet. Every time you step out of the shower or bathtub, you can enjoy superior comfort. Anti-slip :) Non slip bottom is made of PVC material. The middle layer is 25D6 mm sponge, which is more safe and comfortable for your feet. The non-slip bottom helps keeping the mat firmly in place, that it won't slip or slide. !!!Warning!!! — Place mat on Clean Dry Smooth Floor only. Water under mat can cause it to slip. Keep bottom of mat dry. Before using mat, test with foot to ensure it doesn't move.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Iev-IjzyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAYSHINE","source_asin":"B07JLJZKCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JLJZKCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JLJZKCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
