window.products.push({"id":925531,"name":"Melange Naples Stainless Steel Flatware Set (60-Piece) | Service of 12 | Dishwasher Safe Metal Kitchen Silverware Sets | Elegant Knives, Forks and Spo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41joDt-bXkL.jpg","description":"Complement your Dining with an Effortlessly Elegant Flatware Set Upgrade your flatware set with stainless steel silverware strong enough to withstand heavy daily use and elegant enough to complement the fanciest of dinners. Blending premium materials with experienced craftsmanship and timeless detailing, Melange stainless steel flatware treats you to impressive durability, eye-catching aesthetics, and convenient functionality. - Smoothened edges and ergonomic handles. - Complete flatware set for full service. - Frosted look with simple detailing. - Dishwasher safe for hassle-free cleaning. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. All about Durability Our Flatware are crafted from good quality 18/0 stainless steel; You’ll never have to worry about the knives struggling to cut, the spoons bending as you chow away, or the prongs of the forks curling out of shape like others do. Fantastic Designs Make your dining table stand out with a flatware set that is eye-catching without being visually overpowering. Inspired by minimalist elegance, the Melange stainless steel silverware set is designed to beautifully blend into any setting. No cheap-looking gaudy detailing here. Just simple design with clean lines that come off as timeless. Maintenance Made Easy No struggling with pastes and sprays to polish your silverware set. This premium flatware set doesn’t need all that effort to keep it in great condition. The lovely look remains in beautifully shape without your intervention. And with the unique flatware set being dishwasher safe, clean-up will be a breeze! Great Everyday Flatware Set Durable and simple to maintain, this 20-piece/ 30-piece/ 60-piece/ 12-piece flatware set is ideal for the daily rigors of your kitchen. The forks, spoons and knives are ergonomically crafted for a comfortable dining experience. Formal dinner with the family or takeout in front of the TV, this cute flatware set is a great complement to it all","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41joDt-bXkL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B075JFJL1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075JFJL1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075JFJL1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
