window.products.push({"id":925611,"name":"Gingko Edge Light Alarm Clock with Motion Activated Modes & Soft Dimmable Ambient Light, Rechargeable with USD Adaptor Lead, (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zc2oegyvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Inspired from the cutting edge of bamboo, the brand new Gingko Edge Light Alarm Clock is very unique and a must-have edgy design. It's a smart and stylish space saving way to have a clock and a light at the same time either on your bedside or office table, or even simply fancy a nice travel light and clock. ? When used as an alarm clock, the Edge Light Alarm Clock is very easy to use and set up thanks to its great ergonomic design. Powered by in-built rechargeable battery (USB charging adapter lead included), the Edge Light Alarm Clock is featured two alarms with shake snooze and dimmable soft screen light, so you can nicely see the time at night when needed whilst not disturbing your sleep. To turn off the alarm, just simply flip it over and it will instantly turn itself into a warm soft and cosy dimmable ambient light. ? The Edge Light Alarm Clock designed and manufactured by Gingko reflects their design ethos and commitment to modern, functional yet stylish and great design. Edge Light Alarm Clock Features: - dual alarms clock in 24 or 12 hours format - shake the product to snooze or press any button / flip over to stop the alarm - powered by integrated rechargeable battery 1200mAh, USB charging lead included. - dimmable ambient light and clock face screen display light - charging time: approx. 3 hours - battery life time after one charge : 5-6 months when only in alarm clock use or approx. 17.5 hours when the light in brightness mode use /160 hours when the light in the darkest mode use - product material: ABS + PC - power charging input: 5V - 500mA - product colour: Green, Pink, White, Grey - product size: 80 x 80 x 95mm (L x W x H) - product weight: 158g","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zc2oegyvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gingko","source_asin":"B07KKGJBZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KKGJBZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KKGJBZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":925612,"name":"Kitsure Kitchen Mat , Waterproof & Non-Slip Kitchen Rug, 17.3''×47'', Anti-Fatigue Mat for Kitchen Floor, Office & Laundry, Durable Resilient Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710XA9tpDhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANTI-FATIGUE & COMFORTABLE: Kitsure kitchen rug is designed on the principle of ergonomics. The 0.4-inch anti-fatigue kitchen mat creates a perfect blend of support and softness for standing in any kitchen areas. Moreover, the memory foam kitchen mat can protect the fragile kitchenware such as bowls and dishes from breaking when falling on the mat. DURABLE & EASY-CLEANING: The kitchen rug is made of premium PVC, which provides great strength and longevity against deformation. The waterproof and oil-resistant runner rug for kitchen floor with a smooth surface is also convenient to clean up. Simply clear dust on the mat with a vacuum cleaner or wipe stains with a damp cloth or sponge. NON-SLIPPING & STABLE: This anti-fatigue mat for standing includes a non-slipping backing which offers perfect protection for kids and pets on multiple surfaces, such as wood, ceramic, laminate, marble, concrete. (Note: Please place the kitchen mat on DRY FLAT SURFACES, otherwise the wet floor may lead to unexpected falling.) UNIVERSAL & HIGH-QUALITY: The rug for kitchen is measured as 17.3'' x 47'' in dimension with a thickness of 0.4 inch. The universal size makes it suitable for most kitchen areas no matter what size the space is. Besides, the upgraded material of kitchen floor mat with the soft memory foam will not bring any pungent odors when in use. VERSATILE & STYLISH: The kitchen floor mat in front of sink can match any home and kitchen decor styles easily with the stylish geometric pattern. The Kitsure mat not only serves as anti-fatigue kitchen mat but also works for varieties of space both indoors and outdoors, such as laundry room, office, doorway, balcony, farmhouse, and other working places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710XA9tpDhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitsure","source_asin":"B08Z74QCTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z74QCTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z74QCTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
