window.products.push({"id":925717,"name":"Taco Holder Stand with 2 Removable Salsa Guacamole Serving Cups - Rustproof Stainless-Steel Taco Rack - Anti Grip Caps - Holds 3 Hard/Soft-Shell Tacos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VYykhrxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you love Tacos but get frustrated when all of your ingredients spill out and leave a mess on your plate? No more worries!! we are presenting you the all new tacos rack which will keep the tacos shells upright so you can easily fill the shell without making a mess. 2 pairs can hold upto 6 tacos and comes with 4 serving cups. You can serve salsa sauce, guacamole, ketchup, mustard, mayonnaise, or any other dip you prefer. High Quality Material: Adopted with durable and safe 304 food level stainless steel, the stand up holders are great complement to any kitchen, dish, or dining table; Will last for a lifetime. Easy to Clean & Storage: When the meal is over, toss these in the dish-washer, then stack them in a drawer, cupboard or hang them on a hook. Storage is very simple. Multiple Use You can enjoy Your Tacos, Tortillas, Hot Dogs & Other Kinds Of Hot Sandwiches. Elegant Design: Whether you have a concession stand or just want to make Taco Tuesdays look professional, this sleek metal rack is the way to go. Press Buy It Now button and it will be all yours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VYykhrxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maanic","source_asin":"B07D2M3WJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2M3WJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2M3WJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":925718,"name":"ABAKAN Egyptian Cotton Sheets King Size (4 Pieces) - 600 Thread Count Extra Long Staple 100% Organic Cotton Percale Sheets Fits Mattresses Up to 14'' ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-zgefNKCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 100% High-Quality Cotton 】Abakan sheet sets are made of 100% Long Staple Egyptian cotton, not ordinary cotton. It is more smooth and skin-friendly. We removed short fibers and only left long-staple cotton fiber which means stronger and softer, and adopt the newest sewing technology. 【 Newest Temperature Regulation Technology 】Cotton fiber has the advantages of porosity and high elasticity. If you sleep hot, this cotton fabric will release your body heat as you sweat and help to keep you at a comfortable body temperature throughout the night. It will lock heat to keep you warm during winter and cool during summer. 【 Stringent Product Testing 】Every inch of our fabric meets top performance American standards for pilling, shrinkage, colorfastness, strength, and thread count. Each piece of fabric is measured individually and stitched to perfection. 【 Deep Pocket & Precision Fit 】 King size include 4 piece bed sheet sets: 1 Flat Sheet 102x105 inch, 1 Fitted Sheet 78x80 inch, 2 Pillow Cases 20x36 inch. Deep pocket fits mattresses up to 14 inch deep. Shrink and wrinkle resistant. Machine wash cold, do not use bleach, tumble dry low. 【 Guarantee & Service 】Money back guarantee if you are not 100% satisfied. We attach great importance to customer experience and want to run the product for a long time. If you receive the products with quality problems or don't like our products, please feel free to contact us and we will give you a satisfactory reply in the first time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-zgefNKCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABAKAN","source_asin":"B07XRH5633","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XRH5633","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XRH5633","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
