window.products.push({"id":925797,"name":"KBS Bread Maker-710W Dual Heaters, 17-in-1 Bread Machine Stainless Steel with Auto Nut Dispenser&Ceramic Pan, Gluten-Free, Dough Maker,Jam,Yogurt PROG","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":158.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bmiqme71L._AC_SL1481_.jpg","description":"🍞【17 Wide Variety Menus & 2 LB Large Capacity & 2 Custom Modes】More Than A Bread Maker. KBS Automatic Bread Maker Machine has 17 automatic programs to choose from (Gluten-Free, French, Whole Wheat, Sourdough, Pizza dough kneading, Fermentation, Jam, Yogurt, Cake, etc). The bead maker automatically kneads, rises and bakes. It has 3 loaf capacity of 1/1.5 /2.0 lb, 3 crust color options in light/medium/dark. 2 customize programs, set the fermentation and baking time according to your needs. 🔥【710W Upgraded Dual Heaters & Unique Non-stick Ceramic Pan】710W high power bread maker has improved 360° dual heaters, on the bottom and top of the baking pan that promote even baking and browning, most precise sensing the temperature of the cavity and intelligently regulate the baking process. Non-stick Ceramic Coating Pan is designed to make the bread evenly baked,premium healthier and easy to clean. Perfect gift for upcoming Mother's Day, health-conscious family and friend. 🍓【Intelligent Fruit and Nut Dispenser & Sleek Stainless Steel Design】The detachable fruit nut dispenser automatically releases the ingredients at the optimum time. Stainless steel for long-lasting durability, elegant black exterior, and tempered glass cover make the bread maker more like a work of art, blend in well with any kitchen décor, compact small footprint design perfect for any counter, saving space. Non-skid feet allow it to stand steadily on the smooth counter when mixing. ⏰【Advanced Touch Panel Control & 15H Timer, 1H Automatic Warm-keeping Function & Extra 8 Accessories】The digital bread making machine is equipped with a large intuitive touch panel, which makes the operation easier and more precise. 15-hour Delay Timer perfect for breakfast without getting up early, 1-Hour Automatic Keep Warm, 15-minute Power Failure Backup allows for fresh bread anytime. Useful accessories include: Extra thicken oven mitt, Measuring Cup/Spoon, Hook, etc. 🥯【Precise 360° Baking Technology & Various Recipes Provided】Engineered with precision baking technology and 710w of output power, KBS Bread Maker produces soft bouncy bread with consistent, even textures and retains rich nutrients, homemade bread is not only tastier but also healthier (fresher), saving time and money. Thoughtfully designed for the novice, the automatic bread machine is incredibly easy to use, the most important: turn out excellent results!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bmiqme71L._AC_SL1481_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANA","source_asin":"B0C1B64Z2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1B64Z2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1B64Z2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
