window.products.push({"id":925833,"name":"Skull Backflow Incense Holder Ceramics Waterfall Incense Burner Incense Stick Holder with Incense Stick, Incense Cones for Ornament Home Decor (Lotus ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XF9HbLaQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Material : Ceramics Multi-Function & Apply Occasion Our backflow incense burner as a aromatherapy ornamental which has a rich aroma and a long fragrance, helps to meditate and relax,relieve stress and improve sleep quality. Widely used in the living room, bedroom, study, office, meditation room, yoga room, temple, etc, it can create a comfortable atmosphere and purify the air. How to use? Choose a flat, windless place, such as a table or nightstand, and make sure that no air flows through, such as air conditioning or fans. Ignite the sharp portion of the top of the incense cone and observe if the smoke is flowing from the bottom hole. Align the hole at the bottom of the incense cone with the hole at the top of the incense holder for optimum flue gas flow. The smoke will slowly stream down, a dreamlike waterfall shows. Why choose our backflow incense burner？ You can use it to help purify the air, meditate and relax, relieve stress, spark inspiration and improve sleep quality,a great additions for good sleeping. It is easy to clean since it can be washed with water, or directly wipe it with plaster. Package included 1 x Incense Burner 20 x Incense Cones 30 x Incense Sticks Warm Tips: After burning the cones, it leaves yellow liquid and ash on the censer Wash it with hot water and air dry naturally. Attention: 1. Please kindly allow 1-2cm deviation due to MANUAL MEASUREMENT. 2. Colors may appear slightly different via website due to computer PICTURE RESOLUTION and monitor settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XF9HbLaQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YYW","source_asin":"B09C3H6QKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-925833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C3H6QKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C3H6QKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
